# Keep repository contracts and source/configuration artifacts visible:
# AGENTS.md, AAA_v3_BUILD_SPEC.md, SPRINTS.md, docs/, source, tests, .env.example,
# Dockerfiles, compose files, Makefile, migrations, and ADRs are intentionally not ignored.
